{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/Merge_them_all_ENG.png?t=1749115545\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/GIFSingle.gif?t=1749115545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't let the sweets get outside the dome. Merge them together, and make the biggest candy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're about to dive into a sugary adventure! Combine sweets, and prepare yourself for a sugar overload! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather extraordinary powers that can save you from any sticky situation. Mix them up, and you might create something even more powerful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Journey through worlds full of surprises. Each has its own set of challenges. Can you master them all and merge the largest sweet?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/Play_With_Friends__0000s_0028_ENG.png?t=1749115545\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/GIFMulti.gif?t=1749115545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online leaderboards to show off your skills!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Co-op mode for you and your friend!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 2 maps with crazy mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Awesome, game-changing power-ups!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Fully customizable name and character</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> An adorably sweet aesthetic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sweeten your day with a new high score!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3325860?t=1749115545","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749115545","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/dc7eb5d8981b85b6ed730d0d3cbb6d9663d16488/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749115545","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/dc7eb5d8981b85b6ed730d0d3cbb6d9663d16488/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749115545","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0\u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/Merge_them_all_ENG.png?t=1749115545\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3325860/extras/GIFSingle.gif?t=1749115545\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Don't let the sweets get outside the dome. Merge them together, and make the biggest candy!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're about to dive into a sugary adventure! Combine sweets, and prepare yourself for a sugar overload! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather extraordinary powers that can save you from any sticky situation. Mix them up, and you might cre